[{"title":"暮春日与客同登虎邱西阁","author":"郭谏臣","text":"高阁倚岩西，层轩落翠微。\n一帘残雨尽，千顷暮云飞。\n天晚鸟将倦，春深花渐稀。\n移樽续胜赏，潦倒顿忘归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22520,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜步月口占","author":"郭谏臣","text":"春云轻护月，香雾煖浮空。\n院锁莺花夕，林吹燕麦风。\n酒怜樽易罄，诗苦句难工。\n寒食来朝是，村村送落红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22521,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居","author":"郭谏臣","text":"抱病连朝未破颜，柴门花落昼常关。\n呼童扫室焚香坐，消受村居一味閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22522,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水南别业","author":"郭谏臣","text":"日长庭院午风微，春远柴荆客到稀。\n久雨园林花乱落，新晴帘幕燕初飞。\n门临绿水堪垂钓，坐对青山欲振衣。\n屈指当今游宦客，重重甲第几人归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22523,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊南桥移樽桥上玩月","author":"郭谏臣","text":"湖上风生席，帆收月满船。\n桥临芳树杪，酒送白云边。\n春老花将尽，宵分客未眠。\n故人同话旧，潦倒醉青毡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22524,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晚同登惠山","author":"郭谏臣","text":"花落清明后，扁舟载酒来。\n山从一径入，寺绕万松回。\n池上泉声细，樽前暮色催。\n杖头钱未罄，沽取尽馀杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22525,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日宴宫詹吴公园亭","author":"郭谏臣","text":"湖上停兰棹，仙源此地逢。\n径幽群树合，雨过百花浓。\n池阁风鸣树，家山云护峰。\n笑谈方竟日，明发且从容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22526,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜发阳羡","author":"郭谏臣","text":"信宿名园里，扬舲出义兴。\n春寒频对酒，夜雨独挑灯。\n远信时同鹤，孤眠近类僧。\n归途风正好，竟夕到毗陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22527,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丹阳与家兄弟舟中叙话","author":"郭谏臣","text":"江郭移孤棹，时逢谷雨新。\n莺花三月暮，燕麦万家春。\n野店沽村酿，行厨荐渚蘋。\n谢家兄与弟，客路更相亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22528,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游昌国寺","author":"郭谏臣","text":"古寺空山里，危楼积翠边。\n讲堂凝法雨，茶灶散炊烟。\n树引游丝住，风随落絮颠。\n僧家方午饷，抱瓮汲清泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22529,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚登大茅峰","author":"郭谏臣","text":"西日斜悬句曲峰，中天削出玉芙蓉。\n云归绝顶迷春岫，烟起深林翳晚钟。\n怪石岩前蹲虎豹，长松涧底走虬龙。\n临高遥向金陵望，王气千年正郁葱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22530,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自茅峰回赴丹阳","author":"郭谏臣","text":"春山青不了，回首望空迷。\n落絮黏蛛网，残红逐马蹄。\n人行香雾里，路转画桥西。\n为阻连宵雨，游人半未齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22531,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠孔曲山秀才","author":"郭谏臣","text":"稚圭高卧曲山阳，千载移文日月光。\n燕雀未知鸿鹄志，羽翰一任海天长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22532,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"毗陵别伊仪部同年北上","author":"郭谏臣","text":"春风一棹过毗陵，握手匆匆别恨增。\n我欲南还君北上，夜深篷底独挑灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22533,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上巳日与客同登虎邱二首 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"连朝伏枕因中酒，此日登山更举杯。\n芳草已从香径合，残花犹傍暮春开。\n日临山色当楼满，风度泉声曲涧回。\n自是邀游兴成癖，扁舟湖上许重来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22534,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上巳日与客同登虎邱二首 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"剑池春色绿沾衣，把酒登临入翠微。\n几处欢呼追胜赏，一番歌舞竟斜晖。\n莺藏琪树间关语，燕逐杨花高下飞。\n上巳风光时正好，共君潦倒未须归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22535,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王仪部同年分巡东浙","author":"郭谏臣","text":"胥江春雨后，送客剡溪游。\n帆向天边落，舟从树杪浮。\n越中新宪节，吴下旧风流。\n遥想山阴夜，高情属子猷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22536,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池亭月夜迟客不至漫兴","author":"郭谏臣","text":"山公池上月，澄霁似中秋。\n深树烟初歇，晴空水欲流。\n美人期不至，华馆自淹留。\n独酌仍多兴，狂吟倚蒯缑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22537,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中登蠡东水阁","author":"郭谏臣","text":"雨洗园林润，风生水阁寒。\n池荷初起盖，篱笋渐成竿。\n曲槛临花外，高窗隐树端。\n闻来此登眺，顿觉眼前宽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22538,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中逢人道姓名因口占一绝","author":"郭谏臣","text":"春去犹乘雀舫行，晚山罨画半阴晴。\n投閒此地频来往，休讶山人识姓名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22539,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蠡东别业","author":"郭谏臣","text":"青郊开别业，绿水抱孤村。\n旭日鸡豚散，芳春竹树繁。\n苔侵蒋诩径，云护辟疆园。\n邻舍香醪熟，还闻夜扣门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22540,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中晚眺","author":"郭谏臣","text":"凉风天末起，湖上送归桡。\n返照和烟暝，残虹带雨消。\n孤村时吠犬，深树已鸣蜩。\n坐看东山月，相将不待邀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22541,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城归喜雨","author":"郭谏臣","text":"晨出望齐门，舟前水气昏。\n远山云似墨，近郭雨倾盆。\n雷电连空起，蛟龙出海奔。\n山农俱满望，忭舞遍郊原。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22542,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池亭雨后","author":"郭谏臣","text":"华馆开林末，新凉生雨馀。\n荷香飘座远，山色逗窗虚。\n避俗千竿竹，消间满架书。\n连朝厌城市，来此称幽居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22543,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日放舟过蠡东别业","author":"郭谏臣","text":"扬舲过蠡口，言往习池游。\n竹径红尘远，柴门绿水流。\n一樽时遣兴，竟日可消忧。\n坐久凉风发，林塘六月秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22544,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看童子种豆","author":"郭谏臣","text":"傍檐时艺豆，插竹便成篱。\n蔓引清风入，花凝晓露滋。\n先秋凉瑟瑟，带月影离离。\n相对茅茨下，幽居兴在兹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22545,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日书斋二绝 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"香消日正长，蝉鸣梦初醒。\n睡起立空阶，梧桐落清影。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22546,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日书斋二绝 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"苦暑忘冠履，消閒对弈棋。\n绿阴满窗户，正好纳凉时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22547,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池亭望雨不至","author":"郭谏臣","text":"江乡千里旱，处处桔槔声。\n树底蝉鸣晚，檐牙鹊噪晴。\n疾风吹雨散，落日照川明。\n陇上农家子，难禁怅望情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22548,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蠡东书舍即事","author":"郭谏臣","text":"清溪抱村落，深树锁烟霞。\n客至开三径，閒来共五车。\n凉生苍玉簟，风落紫薇花。\n向晚逍遥坐，池台月色赊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22549,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江村雨后","author":"郭谏臣","text":"山雨朝来湿满城，郊原无复桔槔声。\n石床云过琴书润，水槛风生枕簟清。\n林驻淡烟迷竹树，溪浮新绿绕柴荆。\n蠡塘数里荷花发，还拟扁舟弄晚晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22550,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早秋日书舍","author":"郭谏臣","text":"槐庭日正长，梧院秋偏早。\n风落紫薇花，满地无人扫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22551,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早秋日游王比部园亭","author":"郭谏臣","text":"摩诘城南第，名园枕曲流。\n竹林堪避暑，梧院早知秋。\n扫径苔痕破，开帘树影浮。\n兰樽同笑语，竟日此淹留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22552,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"穆宗登遐书感","author":"郭谏臣","text":"闻说君王弃万几，孤臣千里泪沾衣。\n鼎湖此日乘龙去，蜀地何年化鸟归。\n晓兔空从金殿落，秋萤时向玉阶飞。\n遥知弓剑桥山畔，曙色苍茫薤露微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22553,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邀方司训同往蠡东别业","author":"郭谏臣","text":"已下迎徐榻，言迟访戴舟。\n孤村禾黍晚，数里蓼花秋。\n且莫归青嶂，还来看白鸥。\n百年能有几，宁惜片时留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22554,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日方司训过访二首 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"雨过园林后，新凉满树梢。\n劳君携杖履，访我扣衡茅。\n水槛横渔艇，松门隐鹤巢。\n故人同笑语，尘网暂时抛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22555,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日方司训过访二首 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"地僻少来客，居閒时不冠。\n孤亭浮水面，乔木上云端。\n雨滴琴樽润，风清枕簟寒。\n呼僮絷君马，信宿且盘桓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22556,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早秋日与客游虎邱","author":"郭谏臣","text":"古寺空山里，聊因避暑来。\n路从松下入，门向竹间开。\n深树蝉声集，层轩鸟道回。\n相将孤月上，樽酒许重陪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22557,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仰苏楼晚眺","author":"郭谏臣","text":"高阁凭虚起，重阑俯翠岑。\n客来原有约，云出自无心。\n黄叶凝秋思，青松碍日阴。\n北窗天欲雨，凉气坐来侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22558,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池亭晚霁","author":"郭谏臣","text":"江皋初雨霁，凉思袭荷衣。\n乔木生灵籁，孤亭送落晖。\n波翻菱叶乱，露泫豆花肥。\n苔径閒来合，应知过客稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22559,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东楼晚眺","author":"郭谏臣","text":"散帙倚东楼，川原一望收。\n蝉鸣黄叶寺，凫下白蘋洲。\n落日青山外，西风古渡头。\n江乡景堪爱，禾黍万家秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22560,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池上新构小斋","author":"郭谏臣","text":"诛茅营小构，面水敞晴轩。\n俗驾时堪避，清阴日正繁。\n开帘看竹色，涉径破苔痕。\n客有知音者，频过不厌烦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22561,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊松陵","author":"郭谏臣","text":"挂帆过笠泽，舣棹问鲈鱼。\n古寺垂杨里，长桥荒藓馀。\n烟云秋壑冷，水月夜船虚。\n钓雪滩边路，他年拟卜居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22562,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉禾道中","author":"郭谏臣","text":"观潮缘久约，放棹复乘閒。\n片雨嘉禾外，孤云笠泽间。\n捲帘看绿水，把酒对青山。\n雅性耽清赏，扁舟未拟还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22563,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"崇德道中喜晴","author":"郭谏臣","text":"久雨初开霁，天垂别样青。\n风生秋水练，云敛暮山屏。\n疏柳官桥路，寒花古驿亭。\n遨游此乘兴，相对酒俱醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22564,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中晚眺","author":"郭谏臣","text":"湖上西风锦缆开，晴沙白石水萦回。\n蓼花洲转河桥曲，落日渔舟荡桨来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22565,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月十六日与客同游西湖","author":"郭谏臣","text":"芒鞋同上泛湖船，万顷波光一镜圆。\n日映诸峰浮水面，云扶高塔倚山巅。\n幽花曲渚横秋色，疏柳长堤起暮烟。\n准拟今宵明月夜，与君潦倒不须眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22566,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒和靖祠","author":"郭谏臣","text":"同上钓鱼艇，閒登放鹤亭。\n祠临秋水碧，湖带远峰青。\n荒砌多苔藓，乔松长茯苓。\n遐哉林处士，千载仰仪刑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22567,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上观潮","author":"郭谏臣","text":"昨泛湖中棹，今登江上台。\n忽惊沧国内，遥驾雪山来。\n势比行天马，声疑奋地雷。\n鲸翻渤澥动，龙激禹门开。\n汜滥江湖溢，奔腾天地回。\n黄云凝未散，白鸟骇飞回。\n不是瞿塘峡，虚浮滟滪堆。\n难忘越人恨，空抱伍胥哀。\n吊古应多赋，临风愧不才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22568,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒岳庙一首","author":"郭谏臣","text":"曾于青史想容仪，此日登临过古祠。\n壮志未能忘北狩，忠魂犹自倚南枝。\n矢心天地图恢复，唾手燕云在指麾。\n千载英雄常涕泪，金牌何事即班师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22569,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日同王佥宪刘大参游石屋洞天仙台","author":"郭谏臣","text":"长松十里路盘旋，石屋深藏古洞天。\n林下诸僧閒白日，空中孤鹤下苍烟。\n青山社许陶彭泽，丹灶砂逢葛稚川。\n最爱曲江花里伴，一樽潦倒白云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22570,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游飞来峰","author":"郭谏臣","text":"中天飞下青芙蓉，峭壁巉岩千万重。\n仙境霞明金错落，洞天云露玉玲珑。\n古藤乱系将崩石，老桧双扶欲堕峰。\n海上三山何处是，恍然此地或相逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22571,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中寄贵州滕宪副同年","author":"郭谏臣","text":"忆昔同为选部郎，可怜别后各参商。\n一封书寄南飞雁，万里随风到贵阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22572,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日过云间谒少师徐公","author":"郭谏臣","text":"江乡秋色满东篱，相国归来鬓已丝。\n试问华亭明月夜，鹤声谁似漏声迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22573,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟发云间","author":"郭谏臣","text":"晓发云间驿，风生水国秋。\n潮痕平两岸，帆影漾中流。\n共泛杯中蚁，閒看水上鸥。\n何时脱尘鞅，虾菜五湖舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22574,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中晚眺","author":"郭谏臣","text":"落日低沉阁，残霞倒浸江。\n轻帆晴片片，归鸟暮双双。\n酒兴随时发，诗魔未肯降。\n閒心对流水，独立倚篷窗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22575,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"千墩晓发","author":"郭谏臣","text":"残酒初醒后，江天欲曙时。\n鸡声催棹发，月影逐帆移。\n湖海牵游兴，家园入梦思。\n芙蓉花正好，似与主人期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22576,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昆山晚归","author":"郭谏臣","text":"昆山犹在目，挂席又唯亭。\n湖外蘋花白，霜前枫叶青。\n樯乌随落日，水鸟下寒汀。\n归路天将暮，柴门半未扃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22577,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送蒋祠部出守高凉","author":"郭谏臣","text":"南宫初出守，万里驾星轺。\n报国丹心在，辞亲白发饶。\n高凉日渐迩，炎海瘴应消。\n握手难为别，知君懒折腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22578,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重阳日与客池亭小饮","author":"郭谏臣","text":"江乡逢令节，携酒醉重阳。\n枫叶经霜变，芙蓉近水芳。\n淡烟生竹坞，宿雨暗池塘。\n检点年来事，园林日正长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22579,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜书斋独宿","author":"郭谏臣","text":"泽国秋将尽，书斋夜欲分。\n孤灯悬壁照，落叶隔窗闻。\n啼月乌栖树，随风雁入云。\n寒衾清不寐，耿耿惜离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22580,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中登蠡东水阁","author":"郭谏臣","text":"水阁初冬候，閒来时独登。\n雨中闻药臼，林末挂渔罾。\n苔晕侵窗长，茶烟傍竹凝。\n临风思无限，寂寞曲阑凭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22581,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后登楼晚眺","author":"郭谏臣","text":"雨洗尘氛尽，风高朔气侵。\n凝眸时远眺，抱膝更长吟。\n浩荡乾坤阔，淹留岁月深。\n飘然生逖想，千载达人心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22582,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜同诸友小集二首 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"空林悬片月，良夜步清溪。\n野渡烟初起，寒原烧欲迷。\n犬迎群客吠，鹊绕一枝栖。\n对景偏多兴，兰樽月下携。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22583,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜同诸友小集二首 其二","author":"郭谏臣","text":"寂寞书斋静，柴门喜客过。\n开樽还旅坐，对月起高歌。\n树影当阶乱，霜华拂袂多。\n酒阑宾客散，试问夜如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22584,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城中夜归","author":"郭谏臣","text":"江郭寒鸦暝，篷窗暮色催。\n孤舟连夜发，数里带星回。\n灯火沿村起，柴扉逐水开。\n草堂人未寝，相对共衔杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22585,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚泊震泽","author":"郭谏臣","text":"宴罢司空宅，舟回笠泽滨。\n霞明鸡误晓，沙白鹭迷津。\n虾菜湖乡味，羊裘客路贫。\n篷窗閒立久，月色正宜人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22586,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓发碛礇枕上口占","author":"郭谏臣","text":"残酒初醒后，寒灯欲灭时。\n霜飞蓬户早，月落戍楼迟。\n未解闻鸡舞，徒兴梦鹿思。\n诗成还稳睡，此意少人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22587,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蠡东书馆寒夜有怀","author":"郭谏臣","text":"别业三冬后，书斋五夜长。\n风摇银烛影，火烬玉炉香。\n古木乌栖月，晴空雁唳霜。\n寒衾人独寤，耿耿忆鹓行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22588,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕二绝 其一","author":"郭谏臣","text":"泽国今宵岁欲除，小斋无寐独踌躇。\n朝来天子新开历，还见春风到草庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":22589,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]